{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creativity is your strongest tool in this game as every ball and peg serves a specific purpose you might utilize in some completely unthinkable way. There are no bad items, you just need to find a use for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is very simple on the surface, the complexity comes when trying to combine the functions of different pegs in a way that will get you passed the score requirement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929350/extras/8ecd538891d5c0dfee80fb4daf32d726.poster.avif?t=1756380335\" width=600 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929350/extras/8ecd538891d5c0dfee80fb4daf32d726.webm?t=1756380335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929350/extras/8ecd538891d5c0dfee80fb4daf32d726.mp4?t=1756380335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Despite the goal being to simply pass the score requirement, the way you do so changes drastically from run to run, making every run truly feel unique. Here's some things to try the next time you ploink.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Placing balls onto an umbrella and shooting them with mortars and turrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making chickens lay a bunch of eggs so you can feed your virtual pet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buffing beehives with outlets and swarming the board with bees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having a cell duplicate a virus a bunch of times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sending balls to a pocket dimension filled with nukes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929350/extras/d28164458a0cd8130286df8c3e693852.poster.avif?t=1756380335\" width=450 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929350/extras/d28164458a0cd8130286df8c3e693852.webm?t=1756380335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929350/extras/d28164458a0cd8130286df8c3e693852.mp4?t=1756380335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in development, but progress is being made rapidly. As of right now the game (and demo) feature around:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 pegs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 balls</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929350?t=1756380335","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929350/9ad64ca278d38797f7ca524dc4eaa9df86335a14/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756380335","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929350/7f7d7ac203ae7cb3f3f0ea9734aa8c65f002355c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756380335","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929350/7f7d7ac203ae7cb3f3f0ea9734aa8c65f002355c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756380335","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3932590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creativity is your strongest tool in this game as every ball and peg serves a specific purpose you might utilize in some completely unthinkable way. There are no bad items, you just need to find a use for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is very simple on the surface, the complexity comes when trying to combine the functions of different pegs